# The attacked and clan-attacked hooks of GludioHold (a knight, 35235, and a court guard,
# 35238) and GludioBowGuard (35241), Aden's guards, of the clan aden_siege_clan within 300.
# A fixture guard has 440 hit points: a hit of 22 is a twentieth of them. The knight's own
# attacked hook wants to attack the character by 100 for it, and the hit's clan calls, which
# reach the knight itself first, then its clan mates in range, add 50 each: to the knight,
# the court guard (GludioHold's clan-attacked hook) and the bow guard (its own). The built-in
# attacked hate stays off for a bound id, so the hate is the hooks' weights alone. A second
# such hit, on the bow guard, adds its own 100 and 50, and 50 to each clan mate. None of it
# sends a packet.
character Hunter 20
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
script script.ai.siegeguards.GludioHold.GludioBowGuard
script script.ai.siegeguards.GludioHold.GludioCourtGuard
script script.ai.siegeguards.GludioHold.GludioHold
script script.ai.siegeguards.GludioHold.GludioKnight
npc knight 35235 SiegeGuard 100 0 0 walks clan aden_siege_clan 300
npc court 35238 SiegeGuard 0 100 0 walks clan aden_siege_clan 300
npc bow 35241 SiegeGuard 0 -100 0 walks clan aden_siege_clan 300

hit knight 22
  hate knight 150
  hate court 50
  hate bow 50
  desires knight attack(player)=150
  desires court attack(player)=50
  desires bow attack(player)=50

hit bow 22
  hate knight 200
  hate court 100
  hate bow 200
  desires knight attack(player)=200
  desires court attack(player)=100
  desires bow attack(player)=200
